    "section": "Kinetic Slot Weapons",
    "snapshot": {
      "plain": "Kinetic Adaptive Sidearm\n\nKills grants a stack of Gathering Light, up to a maximum of 10 stacks.\nGathering Light grants up to +100 Handling, 0.8x Handling Duration Multiplier, +50 Reload Speed, 0.8x Reload Duration Multiplier, and +20 Aim Assist.\nGathering Light stacks persist through stow. Stats are practically maxed out at 3 stacks already.\n\nGathering Light x1 | +24 Reload Speed, +12 Handling, +5 Aim Assist\nGathering Light x2 | +40 Reload Speed, +20 Handling, +8 Aim Assist\nGathering Light x3 | +53 Reload Speed, +27 Handling, +11 Aim Assist\nGathering Light x4 | +64 Reload Speed, +32 Handling, +13 Aim Assist\nGathering Light x5 | +74 Reload Speed, +37 Handling, +15 Aim Assist\n\nHolding [Reload] will trigger a special reload animation, consuming all stacks of Gathering Light to provide Ability Energy.\nGrants 10% Grenade, Melee, and Class Ability Energy per Gathering Light stack\n\n↑Catalyst:\nPassively grants +2 Magazine Size (15 -> 17), the Osmosis trait, and the Surplus trait.",
